GIVEN `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency determined eligibility and the amount of benefits without regard to the participating family` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2031(b)(3)(E)(ii) the State agency determined the individual's eligibility and benefits without regard to the participating family` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "such individuals", the individuals of clause (i)
        IF `the State agency determined eligibility and the amount of benefits without regard to the participating family` THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "shall determine such individuals' eligibility ... and the amount of such benefits without regard to the participating family"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text says what the State agency shall do and not what follows if it does not

-- src:2869 | (iii) In computing such individuals’ income for purposes of determining eligibility (under section 2014(c)(1) of this title) and benefits, the State agency shall apply the maximum excess shelter expense deduction specified under section 2014(e) of this title.
@ref s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iii) the maximum excess shelter expense deduction (src:2869)
GIVEN `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency applied the maximum excess shelter expense deduction specified under section 2014(e)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iii) the State agency applied the maximum excess shelter expense deduction` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "such individuals", the individuals of clause (i)
        IF `the State agency applied the maximum excess shelter expense deduction specified under section 2014(e)` THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "the State agency shall apply the maximum excess shelter expense deduction specified under section 2014(e)"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text says what the State agency shall do and not what follows if it does not

-- src:2870 | (iv) Such individuals’ monthly allotment shall be the higher of $10 or 75 percent of the amount calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program and the foregoing requirements of this subparagraph, rounded to the nearest lower whole dollar.
@ref s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iv) (src:2870)
GIVEN `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 2017 the monthly allotment calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program with the maximum excess shelter expense deduction of section 2014(e) applied, in dollars` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iv) the individual's monthly allotment, in dollars` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 2017 the monthly allotment calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program with the maximum excess shelter expense deduction of section 2014(e) applied, in dollars`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the amount calculated under the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program was not supplied
    WHEN JUST calculated THEN
        IF `the individual is ineligible for the Project and is a member of a household including a participating family`
        THEN JUST (IF FLOOR (75% TIMES calculated) AT LEAST 10 THEN FLOOR (75% TIMES calculated) ELSE 10)   -- "the higher of $10 or 75 percent of the amount calculated ..., rounded to the nearest lower whole dollar" (fork FR-31-1: the order of rounding and "higher of" gives the same answer, since $10 is a whole number)
        ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): (E) speaks of individuals ineligible for the Project who are members of a household including a participating family

-- src:2870 | (iv) Such individuals’ monthly allotment shall be the higher of $10 or 75 percent of the amount calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program and the foregoing requirements of this subparagraph, rounded to the nearest lower whole dollar.
@ref s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iv) the other order (src:2870)
GIVEN `the amount calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2031(b)(3)(E)(iv) the individual's monthly allotment, rounding after taking the higher, in dollars` MEANS
    FLOOR (IF 75% TIMES `the amount calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program, in dollars` AT LEAST 10 THEN 75% TIMES `the amount calculated following the standards of the supplemental nutrition assistance program, in dollars` ELSE 10)

