@ref s 2031(b)(6)(A) the State agency's duty to determine eligibility and issue assistance (src:2874)
`s 2031(b)(6)(A) the State agency's duty to determine eligibility and issue assistance` MEANS
    PARTY `the State agency`
    MUST `s 2031 determine eligibility for the Project and issue assistance to eligible families`
    WITHIN 30   -- days following the family's filing of an application
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the State agency` BECAUSE "the State agency did not determine eligibility and issue assistance within thirty days following the family's filing of an application"

-- src:2874 | (A) the State shall promptly determine eligibility for the Project, and issue assistance to eligible families, retroactive to the date of application, not later than thirty days following the family’s filing of an application;
