    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`s 2031(b)(6) selection is accomplished through submission and approval of an application` way) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Whenever selection for participation in the Project is accomplished through submission and approval of an application"
        IF `the State agency has determined eligibility and issued assistance to the eligible family` AND `days from the family's filing of an application to the day the State agency did so, or to today if it has not` AT MOST 30 THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "not later than thirty days following the family's filing of an application"
        IF `days from the family's filing of an application to the day the State agency did so, or to today if it has not` GREATER THAN 30 THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "not later than thirty days following the family's filing"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): not yet done and the thirty days have not run

