        IF `the State has given notice of the existence of the supplemental nutrition assistance program and the person or agency to contact for more information` THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "notice of the existence of the supplemental nutrition assistance program and the person or agency to contact for more information"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text sets no time for the notice and says nothing of what follows if it is not given

-- (b)(10)(B)(i) "Following the standards specified in subparagraph (C), the State shall ensure that benefits under the supplemental
-- nutrition assistance program are provided to participating families in case the Project is terminated or to participating
