    BRANCH
        IF why EQUALS `s 2031 some other reason` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is for the Project's termination and for ineligibility "because of income, resources, or change in household composition"
        IF `s 2014 the household is found eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program following the standards established under it` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "the State shall ensure that benefits under the supplemental nutrition assistance program are provided ... if such families or individuals are determined eligible"
        IF `s 2014 the household is found eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program following the standards established under it` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): a failed "if such families or individuals are determined eligible" (marginal reading (a))
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): eligibility for the supplemental nutrition assistance program was not supplied

-- src:2891 | (i) Following the standards specified in subparagraph (C), the State shall ensure that benefits under the supplemental nutrition assistance program are provided to participating families in case the Project is terminated or to participating families or family members that are determined ineligible for the Project because of income, resources, or change in household composition, if such families or individuals are determined eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program. Benefits shall be issued to eligible families and individuals described in this clause retroactive to the date of termination from the Project; and
