-- src:2893 | (C) Each family whose Project participation is terminated shall be screened for potential eligibility for the supplemental nutrition assistance program and if the screening indicates potential eligibility, the family or family member shall be given a specific request to supply all additional information needed to determine such eligibility and assistance in completing a signed supplemental nutrition assistance program application including provision of any relevant information obtained by the State for purpose of the Project. If the family or family member supplies such additional information within ten days after receiving the request, the State shall, within five days after the State receives such information, determine whether the family or family member is eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program. Each family or family member who is determined through the screening or otherwise to be ineligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program shall be notified of that determination.
@ref s 2031(b)(10)(C) (the twin over days) (src:2893)
GIVEN `the family or family member supplied the additional information` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days from the family's or family member's receiving the request to its supplying the information` IS A NUMBER
      `the State has determined whether the family or family member is eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days from the State's receiving the information to the determination, or to today if not yet` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2031(b)(10)(C) the State determined eligibility in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the family or family member supplied the additional information`) OR (`days from the family's or family member's receiving the request to its supplying the information` GREATER THAN 10) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the five days run only "If the family or family member supplies such additional information within ten days after receiving the request"
        IF `the State has determined whether the family or family member is eligible for the supplemental nutrition assistance program` AND `days from the State's receiving the information to the determination, or to today if not yet` AT MOST 5 THEN JUST TRUE   -- TRUE-kind: "within five days after the State receives such information"
        IF `days from the State's receiving the information to the determination, or to today if not yet` GREATER THAN 5 THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within five days after the State receives such information"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): not yet determined and the five days have not run

