        IF `the notice is consistent with the notice requirements of the regulations implementing sections 402(a)(4) and 482(h) of the Social Security Act` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "in a manner consistent with the notice requirements of the regulations"
