-- (b)(12) "For each fiscal year, the Secretary shall not be liable for any costs related to carrying out the Project in excess of
-- those that the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented, except for costs for evaluating the
-- Project, but shall adjust for the full amount of the federal share of increases or decreases in costs that result from changes in
-- economic, demographic, and other conditions in the State based on data specific to the State, changes in eligibility or benefit
-- levels authorized by this chapter, or changes in amounts of Federal funds available to States and localities under the
-- supplemental nutrition assistance program." The ceiling is the baseline plus the signed adjustment; evaluation costs are outside it.
-- src:2895 | (12) For each fiscal year, the Secretary shall not be liable for any costs related to carrying out the Project in excess of those that the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented, except for costs for evaluating the Project, but shall adjust for the full amount of the federal share of increases or decreases in costs that result from changes in economic, demographic, and other conditions in the State based on data specific to the State, changes in eligibility or benefit levels authorized by this chapter, or changes in amounts of Federal funds available to States and localities under the supplemental nutrition assistance program.
@ref s 2031(b)(12) the most the Secretary is liable for, other than the cost of evaluating (src:2895)
GIVEN `the costs the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
      `the federal share of the increases (positive) or decreases (negative) in costs that result from changes in conditions in the State, in eligibility or benefit levels, or in Federal funds, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2031(b)(12) the most the Secretary is liable for in the fiscal year, other than costs for evaluating the Project, in dollars` MEANS
    `the costs the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented, in dollars` PLUS `the federal share of the increases (positive) or decreases (negative) in costs that result from changes in conditions in the State, in eligibility or benefit levels, or in Federal funds, in dollars`   -- "shall not be liable ... in excess of those that the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented ... but shall adjust for the full amount of the federal share of increases or decreases"

-- src:2895 | (12) For each fiscal year, the Secretary shall not be liable for any costs related to carrying out the Project in excess of those that the Secretary would have been liable for had the Project not been implemented, except for costs for evaluating the Project, but shall adjust for the full amount of the federal share of increases or decreases in costs that result from changes in economic, demographic, and other conditions in the State based on data specific to the State, changes in eligibility or benefit levels authorized by this chapter, or changes in amounts of Federal funds available to States and localities under the supplemental nutrition assistance program.
@ref s 2031(b)(12) the costs the Secretary is liable for, other than the cost of evaluating (src:2895)
GIVEN `the costs related to carrying out the Project other than the costs for evaluating it, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
      `the most the Secretary is liable for in the fiscal year, other than costs for evaluating the Project, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2031(b)(12) the costs related to carrying out the Project for which the Secretary is liable, in dollars` MEANS
    IF `the costs related to carrying out the Project other than the costs for evaluating it, in dollars` AT MOST `the most the Secretary is liable for in the fiscal year, other than costs for evaluating the Project, in dollars`
    THEN `the costs related to carrying out the Project other than the costs for evaluating it, in dollars`
    ELSE `the most the Secretary is liable for in the fiscal year, other than costs for evaluating the Project, in dollars`   -- "shall not be liable for any costs ... in excess of"

-- (b)(13) "The State shall carry out the supplemental nutrition assistance program throughout the State while the State carries
